 "pitch": "With no training, a three-token opening cue takes the Olmo 3 base model to 82 on MATH-500 at AI2's own sampling setting, against 93 for the RL-trained model. Without the cue the base scores 64 at our first setting and 45 at AI2's. The gap that RL has to explain is about 11 points."
